---
_type: Concept
_label: "Embedded Language"
status: 'learning'
tags:
  - 'dsl classification'
depends_on:
  - fref("02-research/04-glossary/embedded-dsl.td")
---

A scripting language embedded within an application to provide user extensibility. Examples: VBA in Excel, Lua in Redis/Neovim, Scheme in GIMP. Distinct from an embedded DSL (internal DSL), though the terminology overlaps.
